  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"106\">🏎️ Nintendo Switch Stuur – 2 Stuks Origineel | ZGAN | €19,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"352\">Deze <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"159\">originele Nintendo Switch sturen (2 stuks)</strong> zijn ideaal voor racegames zoals Mario Kart 8 Deluxe. De sturen verkeren in <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"264\">ZGAN (Zo Goed Als Nieuw)</strong> staat en zijn volledig getest. Zorgt voor extra speelplezier en realistische besturing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"371\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<li data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"426\">\r\n<p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"426\"><strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"386\">Product:</strong> Nintendo Switch stuur (Joy-Con wheel)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"450\">\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"450\"><strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"440\">Aantal:</strong> 2 stuks</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"502\"><strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"462\">Merk:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">Nintendo</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n<p data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"553\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"525\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> Nintendo Switch (Joy-Con)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"597\">\r\n<p data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"597\"><strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"565\">Type:</strong> Origineel Nintendo accessoire</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"638\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"613\">Toestand:</strong> ZGAN (Zo Goed Als Nieuw)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"653\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<li data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"694\">Realistische besturing bij racegames</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"731\">Perfect voor Mario Kart 8 Deluxe</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"764\">\r\n<p data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"764\">Originele Nintendo kwaliteit</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"794\">Geschikt voor multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"841\">Volledig getest en direct klaar voor gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"852\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"864\"><strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"864\">€ 19,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1240\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"> </p>",
